{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39982","headline":"送王校书往清源 · 徐夤","name":"送王校书往清源","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国贤侯待德风，长途仍借九花骢。\n清歌早贯骊龙[颔]，丹桂曾攀玉兔宫。\n杨柳堤边梅雨熟，鹧鸪声里麦田空。\n吟诗台上如相问，与说蟠溪直钓翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}